* **Dyadic partitions of a rectangle in $\mathbb R^2$.** A partition produced by
  $\textsc{Partition}_2$ ([DIR], §4.1) is recorded as a tree `DTree` (a leaf is a rectangle of the
  partition, a node splits a rectangle into its four dyadic children). `DTree.boxes` lists the
